==English==

===Phrase===
'''[[all]] [[over]] the [[place]]'''

# {{idiom}} [[everywhere]], especially chaotically or in such a way as to make a [[mess]]
#: ''I dropped the hose and the water sprayed '''all over the place'''.''
# {{idiom}} [[inconsistent]]; lacking a clear pattern
#: ''I asked each person in turn, and their answers were '''all over the place'''.''

